# Local planning docs — do not commit

These files are **local-only** and listed in `.gitignore`. Never `git add`, commit, or include them in PRs:

- `docs/improvement-roadmap.md` — private improvement roadmap / release tracking
- `handoff.md` — session handoff notes

When finishing roadmap tasks, update the local file if the user asks, but do **not** commit it. Bump app version in the synced files instead (`package.json`, `apps/desktop/package.json`, `tauri.conf.json`, `Cargo.toml`).
